Subject: [PATCH 06/12] tools/size_report.py: where the app's flash goes, per
 source file and symbol

(Vizzbox) One release ELF: the image (.text + .ram_text + .data) by the
file that defines each symbol (the generated tables as gen/NAME) and the
biggest symbols. Measures the room before the producer, and what it
costs after.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
